\f2\fs28 .LAZ
\f0\fs32  files directly.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Advantage:
\f0\b0  Utah\'92s urban points are already meticulously classified, meaning you can separate houses from the ground with a single click.\
