\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 Once PotreeConverter finishes, it outputs a folder of optimized files. Your Rails controller simply serves a lightweight HTML template containing the open-source 
\f1\b Potree WebGL viewer
\f0\b0 , pointing it directly to that folder asset.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

